{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "钓鱼套件",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 119.71,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "这些钓鱼网站，很多出自同一类工具。",
   "spoken": "这些钓鱼网站，很多出自同一类工具。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.768,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.531
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "它叫 Drainer 即服务。",
   "spoken": "它叫 Drainer 即服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.588,
   "dur": 2.592,
   "speechStart": 5.686,
   "speechEnd": 7.34
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "开发者维护钓鱼套件、合约和后台，把它当作产品出租。",
   "spoken": "开发者维护钓鱼套件、合约和后台，把它荡作产品出租。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 8.4,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 8.498,
   "speechEnd": 13.069
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "分发者负责引流，搭仿冒网站，买广告，盗社交账号。",
   "spoken": "分发者负责引流，搭仿冒网站，买广告，盗社交账号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.14,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 14.238,
   "speechEnd": 19.059
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "链接投到被盗的 X 和 Discord 账号、搜索广告、假空投和私信里。",
   "spoken": "链接投到被盗的 X 和 Discord 账号、搜索广告、假空投和私信里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.12,
   "dur": 6.408,
   "speechStart": 20.218,
   "speechEnd": 25.706
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "受害者一签名，转走的资产自动分账。",
   "spoken": "受害者一签名，转走的资产自动分账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.748,
   "dur": 3.912,
   "speechStart": 26.846,
   "speechEnd": 29.81
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "公开分析显示，开发者抽成约 20%，分发者拿约 80%。",
   "spoken": "公开分析显示，开发者抽成约 20%，分发者拿约 80%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.88,
   "dur": 5.856,
   "speechStart": 30.978,
   "speechEnd": 35.894
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "各家套件的比例不同，也会变。",
   "spoken": "各家套件的比例不同，也会变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 36.956,
   "dur": 3.288,
   "speechStart": 37.054,
   "speechEnd": 39.411
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "套件会先读你钱包里的余额，按价值排序，先请求最值钱的那个授权。",
   "spoken": "套件会先读你钱包里的余额，按价值排序，先请求最值钱的那个授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 40.464,
   "dur": 6.384,
   "speechStart": 40.562,
   "speechEnd": 46.002
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "所以同一个钓鱼站，对不同的人，弹出的签名请求不一样。",
   "spoken": "所以同一个钓鱼站，对不同的人，弹出的签名请求不一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 47.068,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 47.166,
   "speechEnd": 51.868
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "Inferno Drainer 在 2023 年 11 月宣布关停，此前约 7000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "Inferno Drainer 在 2023 年 11 月宣布关停，此前约 7000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 52.928,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 53.026,
   "speechEnd": 58.228
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "2025 年 5 月，Check Point 发现它仍在运行，半年内盗走约 900 万美元以上。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 5 月，Check Point 发现它仍在运行，半年内盗走约 900 万美元以上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 59.292,
   "dur": 6.768,
   "speechStart": 59.39,
   "speechEnd": 65.223
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "这次它在 Discord 冒充 Collab.Land 引流，受害者有 3 万多名。",
   "spoken": "这次它在 Discord 冒充 Collab.Land 引流，受害者有 3 万多名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 66.28,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 66.378,
   "speechEnd": 70.973
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "Pink Drainer 在 2024 年 5 月宣布退休，约 2.1 万名受害者，约 8500 万美元。",
   "spoken": "Pink Drainer 在 2024 年 5 月宣布退休，约 2.1 万名受害者，约 8500 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 72.02,
   "dur": 6.816,
   "speechStart": 72.118,
   "speechEnd": 77.999
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "Angel Drainer 到 2024 年 2 月，约 2500 万美元，同年 7 月停止服务。",
   "spoken": "Angel Drainer 到 2024 年 2 月，约 2500 万美元，同年 7 月停止服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 79.056,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 79.154,
   "speechEnd": 84.701
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "关停不等于消失，套件代码和分发网络，会换个名字回来。",
   "spoken": "关停不等于消失，套件代码和分发网络，会换个名字回来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 85.756,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 85.854,
   "speechEnd": 90.032
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "整体看，2024 年的钓鱼损失约 4.94 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "整体看，2024 年的钓鱼损失约 4.94 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 91.088,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 91.186,
   "speechEnd": 95.59
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "其中百万美元以上的大案里，permit 类占损失的 56.7%。",
   "spoken": "其中百万美元以上的大案里，permit 类占损失的 56.7%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 96.66,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 96.758,
   "speechEnd": 101.734
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "2025 年降到约 8385 万美元，下降约 83%。",
   "spoken": "2025 年降到约 8385 万美元，下降约 83%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 102.808,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 102.906,
   "speechEnd": 107.489
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "报告说，攻击转向小额和高频。",
   "spoken": "报告说，攻击转向小额和高频。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 108.548,
   "dur": 3.696,
   "speechStart": 108.646,
   "speechEnd": 111.396
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "这个统计只算 EVM 链上的 Drainer 钓鱼，不含私钥泄露和交易所被盗。",
